OL,4,CBattery warning after e-bike causes    
OL,5,Chouse fire                             
OL,6,GA lithium-ion battery warning has been 
OL,7,Gissued after a fire at a home in Derby.
OL,9,FFirefighters from three Derby stations 
OL,10,Fwere called to a two-storey property   
OL,11,Fon Peel Street at about 07:20 GMT on   
OL,12,F14 November.                           
OL,14,FThe rented property was fitted with    
OL,15,Fsprinklers which activated and         
OL,16,Fcontained the blaze to the room it     
OL,17,Fbroke out in, allowing four people to  
OL,18,Fevacuate safely, the fire service said.
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
