OL,4,CJury considers verdict in grandfather  
OL,5,Cmurder trial                           
OL,6,GA jury has retired to consider its     
OL,7,Gverdict in the trial of a man accused  
OL,8,Gof murdering a 71-year-old grandfather.
OL,10,FProsecutors allege John Mills, 46,     
OL,11,Fbeat John Boyle to death while he was  
OL,12,Flying in bed at his flat in Kettering, 
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, on 26 October 2025.  
OL,15,FDuring a three-week trial, Mills, of   
OL,16,FMarriott Street in Northampton,        
OL,17,Frepeatedly denied killing Boyle, being 
OL,18,Fpresent at the time of his death or    
OL,19,Fknowing who was responsible.           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
