OL,4,CCritical incident at hospitals over    
OL,5,Cflu and Covid                          
OL,6,GNottingham's hospitals have declared a 
OL,7,Gcritical incident over a rise in flu   
OL,8,Gand Covid-19 cases.                    
OL,10,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)  
OL,11,F- which runs Queen's Medical Centre    
OL,12,F(QMC) and City Hospital - said the     
OL,13,F"sharp increase" in cases had led to   
OL,14,F"pressure on staff and long waits for  
OL,15,Fpatients", particularly in the QMC     
OL,16,Femergency department.                  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
