OL,4,CBrazil World Cup winner attends League 
OL,5,CTwo match                              
OL,6,GFormer footballer Roque Junior, who    
OL,7,Gstarred in the Brazil side which won   
OL,8,Gthe 2002 World Cup, attended a League  
OL,9,GTwo fixture on Saturday.               
OL,11,FJunior, who also won the Champions     
OL,12,FLeague with AC Milan in 2003, watched  
OL,13,Ffrom the stands as Northampton Town    
OL,14,Fbeat Rochdale at Sixfields Stadium.    
OL,16,FNorthampton were recently the subject  
OL,17,Fof a takeover by a Brazilian           
OL,18,Fconsortium featuring Alexandre Pato -  
OL,19,Fwho also played for Brazil and AC      
OL,20,FMilan.                                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
